column14:
(11/Aug): our CL team helped this client in 3 key moments so far:
 1) by proactively monitoring their consumption, we noticed some atypical consumption spikes, invited the SI partner into war room (29/Apr), helped them identify the rootcause LIVE and provided orientation to address it immediately, preserving the client credits from reaching overage;
 2) later on, we helped the SI partner in a 2nd wave of war rooms (22/May), when we tried to foster the importance of thinking through use-cases, separately, but it's unsure how much of such recommendations were welcomed given some delicate conversations which were taking place between SI partner and the client;
 3) finally, in a 3rd wave of war rooms, we helped the account team leadership in preparing for a comercial renegotiation in this client, with some benchmarks, ideas, etc;
 furthermore, more recently, we understood the account team that it would be better to respect some negotiation time till we could resume conversations of such use-case approach;
 it seems the negotiation might be finished and the client apparently closed a deal to expand their contract;
 the next step is to sync with the account team to debrief on that and determine the best initiatives so the client can obtain optimal RoI;

